#: ../../infrastructure/storage/data_stores.rst:2
msgid "Data Stores"
msgstr "Datos Stores"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/data_stores.rst:4
msgid ""
"Data Stores are logical divisions of underlying storage disk. Organizations "
"may use them to divide and track cloud resources by team or department. When"
" integrating certain Cloud types, |morpheus| will onboard all existing data "
"stores and administrators can then make them available to Groups or Tenants "
"as needed. At provision time, when applicable based on Cloud and Layout, "
"users can select the data store they wish to provision to."
msgstr ""
"Datos Stores son logical divisions de underlying storage disco. "
"Organizations puede usar them a divide y track cloud recursos por team o "
"department. Cuando integrating certain Nube tipos, |morpheus| será onboard "
"todos existente datos stores y administrators puede entonces hacer them "
"disponible a Grupos o Inquilinos según sea necesario. En provision tiempo, "
"cuando applicable basado en Nube y Layout, usuarios puede seleccionar el "
"datos store they wish a provision a."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/data_stores.rst:6
msgid ""
"Here within the Data Store view in the storage section, users can see a list"
" of data stores for each Cloud. In the row for each Cloud, the storage type,"
" associated Cloud, and permissions information are shown."
msgstr ""
"Aquí dentro de el Datos Store ver en el storage sección, usuarios puede ver "
"un lista de datos stores para cada Nube. En el row para cada Nube, el "
"storage tipo, associated Nube, y permisos información son mostrado."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/data_stores.rst:9
msgid "Create Data Stores"
msgstr "Crear Datos Stores"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/data_stores.rst:11
msgid ""
"To a limited extent, data stores can be created from this view. Currently, "
"data store creation is restricted to VMware data store creation on 3Par "
"volumes. In order to create such a data store you would need to first have "
"an integrated 3Par server. See the section on storage servers for more "
"information on setting up this integration."
msgstr ""
"A un limited extent, datos stores se puede crear desde este ver. "
"Actualmente, datos store creation es restricted a VMware datos store "
"creation en 3Par volúmenes. Para crear such un datos store you would "
"necesita a primero tienen un integrated 3Par servidor. Consulte la sección "
"en storage servidores para más información en setting up este integration."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/data_stores.rst:13
msgid ""
"For all other data store types, create the needed data store within the "
"target Cloud and |morpheus| will automatically sync in the data store on the"
" next Cloud sync. You can force a Cloud sync from the Cloud Detail Page "
"(Infrastructure > Clouds > Selected Cloud > Refresh Menu > Short)."
msgstr ""
"Para todos otro datos store tipos, crear el necesario datos store dentro de "
"el destino Nube y |morpheus| será automáticamente sync en el datos store en "
"el siguiente Nube sync. You puede force un Nube sync desde el Nube Detail "
"Página (Infraestructura > Nubes > Seleccionado Nube > Refresh Menu > Short)."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/data_stores.rst:15
#: ../../infrastructure/storage/data_stores.rst:26
msgid "Navigate to Infrastructure > Storage > Data Stores"
msgstr "Navegue un Infrastructure > Storage > Datos Stores"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/data_stores.rst:16
msgid "Click :guilabel:`+ADD`"
msgstr "Click :guilabel:`+ADD`"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/data_stores.rst:17
msgid ""
"Enter a Name, select a VMware Cloud, select a 3Par Volume, and select a Host"
" Group"
msgstr ""
"Ingresar un Nombre, seleccionar un VMware Nube, seleccionar un 3Par Volume, "
"y seleccionar un Host Grupo"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/data_stores.rst:18
msgid ""
"Manage permissions in the Group Access and Tenant Permissions sections, if "
"needed"
msgstr ""
"Manage permisos en el Grupo Acceso y Inquilino Permisos sections, si es "
"necesario"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/data_stores.rst:19
#: ../../infrastructure/storage/data_stores.rst:31
msgid "Click :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES`"
msgstr "Click :guilabel:`GUARDAR CAMBIOS`"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/data_stores.rst:22
msgid "Manage Permissions"
msgstr "Manage Permissions"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/data_stores.rst:24
msgid ""
"From this view, users can manage permissions for any data store synced from "
"integrated Clouds. This includes setting which Groups have access to the "
"data store, and which Tenants have access. To edit data store permissions:"
msgstr ""
"Desde este ver, usuarios puede manage permisos para cualquier datos store "
"sincronizado desde integrated Nubes. Este incluye setting cual Grupos tienen"
" acceso al datos store, y cual Inquilinos tienen acceso. A editar datos "
"store permisos:"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/data_stores.rst:27
msgid "Click ACTIONS > Edit"
msgstr "Click ACTIONS > Editar"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/data_stores.rst:28
msgid ""
"**Groups:** Select \"all\" Groups or select specific Groups which should "
"have access to the data store"
msgstr ""
"**Grupos:** Seleccionar \"todos\" Grupos o seleccionar específico Grupos "
"cual debería tienen acceso al datos store"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/data_stores.rst:29
msgid ""
"**Tenants:** Primary Tenant users can opt to make the data store available "
"to all Tenants (public visibility) or to selected Tenants (private "
"visibility with specific Tenants selected). Subtenant users will only be "
"able to make data stores visible to their own Tenant"
msgstr ""
"**Inquilinos:** Primario Inquilino usuarios puede opt a hacer el datos store"
" disponible a todos Inquilinos (público visibility) o a seleccionado "
"Inquilinos (privado visibility con específico Inquilinos seleccionado). "
"Subtenant usuarios será solo be able a hacer datos stores visible a su own "
"Inquilino"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/data_stores.rst:30
msgid ""
"**Active:** When marked, the data store is active and available for "
"provisioning"
msgstr ""
"**Active:** Cuando marked, el datos store está activo y disponible para "
"provisioning"
